# FIX: [2026-07-16 P0] 防止生产密钥/敏感文件进入 Docker 构建上下文
# 任何被 .dockerignore 排除的文件都不会被 docker build 上传到 daemon，
# 即便 Dockerfile 使用精确 COPY，也能避免密钥泄露到镜像层/缓存/registry。

# --- 环境变量与密钥 ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.prod.example
*.env.bak
.env.production.bak
.env.slowapi

# --- 凭证与私钥 ---
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*_private_key*
*_signing_key*

# --- 版本控制 ---
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.gitlab

# --- 日志与运行时数据 ---
logs/
data/
records/
*.log
*.log.*
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# --- Python 缓存与虚拟环境 ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# --- 测试与文档 ---
tests/
test_*.py
*_test.py
conftest.py
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# --- IDE ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- 构建产物 ---
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
node_modules/

# --- Docker 自身（避免递归） ---
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
